{"id":65,"verses":[{"n":1,"g":5218,"tr":"Ya ayyuha alnnabiyyu itha tallaqtumu alnnisaa fatalliqoohunna liAAiddatihinna waahsoo alAAiddata waittaqoo Allaha rabbakum la tukhrijoohunna min buyootihinna wala yakhrujna illa an yateena bifahishatin mubayyinatin watilka hudoodu Allahi waman yataAAadda hudooda Allahi faqad thalama nafsahu la tadree laAAalla Allaha yuhdithu baAAda thalika amran","en":"O Prophet, when you [Muslims] divorce women, divorce them for [the commencement of] their waiting period and keep count of the waiting period, and fear Allah, your Lord. Do not turn them out of their [husbands'] houses, nor should they [themselves] leave [during that period] unless they are committing a clear immorality. And those are the limits [set by] Allah. And whoever transgresses the limits of Allah has certainly wronged himself. You know not; perhaps Allah will bring about after that a [different] matter","w":[{"a":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","t":"yāayyuhā","e":"O","j":[["يَ"],["ـٰٓ","madda_obligatory_mottasel"],["أَيُّهَا"]],"s":850,"f":3240},{"a":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","t":"l-nabiyu","e":"Prophet","j":[["ٱ","ham_wasl"],["ل","laam_shamsiyah"],["نّ","ghunnah"],["َبِىُّ"]],"s":3250,"f":4640},{"a":"إِذَا","t":"idhā","e":"When","j":"إِذَا","s":4650,"f":5190},{"a":"طَلَّقْتُمُ","t":"ṭallaqtumu","e":"you divorce","j":[["طَلَّ"],["قۡ","qalaqah"],["تُمُ"]],"s":5200,"f":6580},{"a":"ٱلنِّسَآءَ","t":"l-nisāa","e":"[the] women","j":[["ٱ","ham_wasl"],["ل","laam_shamsiyah"],["نّ","ghunnah"],["ِس"],["َا","madda_obligatory_mottasel"],["ٓءَ"]],"s":6590,"f":9070},{"a":"فَطَلِّقُوهُنَّ","t":"faṭalliqūhunna","e":"then divorce them","j":[["فَطَلِّقُوهُ"],["نّ","ghunnah"],["َ"]],"s":9080,"f":11490},{"a":"لِعِدَّتِهِنَّ","t":"liʿiddatihinna","e":"for their waiting period","j":[["لِعِدَّتِهِ"],["نّ","ghunnah"],["َ"]],"s":11500,"f":13710},{"a":"وَأَحْصُوا۟","t":"wa-aḥṣū","e":"and keep count","j":[["وَأَحۡصُو"],["اۡ","slnt"]],"s":13720,"f":14580},{"a":"ٱلْعِدَّةَ ۖ","t":"l-ʿidata","e":"(of) the waiting period","j":[